{
  "name": "spider",
  "_about": "SCULPTED (2026-11-05, docs/engines.md 'the sculpt overlay'): a wolf spider, the rig as it was (the drider rides it) -- a low prosoma with the head region raised in front, a pale median band and margins, the fovea; chelicerae with fangs; eight eyes (two big posterior medians forward, four small below, two on top); a narrow pedicel to an oval abdomen with the dark heart mark and pale chevrons, spinnerets behind; each leg a coxa, a femur rising to the knee, patella and tibia arching on and the metatarsus falling to the ground, ringed pale at the joints; club-tipped palps SHARP PASS 2 (2026-11-08): the pointed parts -- fang (1 in all) -- are the engine's sharp `horn`s (sharp.js), made from the field shapes they replaced by tools/creaturegen/sharp/ (claws.py, teeth.py, spikes.py, antlers.py, bills.py): rooted in the body, tips pointed; RE-RUN those after this species' generator.",
